---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: atmosphere::GpuAtmosphereSettings · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**GpuAtmosphereSettings**<br/>向 GPU 提供大气采样和查找表设置。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**extract​_​atmosphere**<br/>为三维相机选择并提取最近的大气。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**atmosphere​_​luts**<br/>根据当前大气、视图和光照参数调度计算管<br/>线，生成透射、多重散射、天空视图及空气透<br/>视查找表，供天空和大气渲染使用。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​uniform​_​components**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：将组件值批量<br/>上传为动态着色器参数。" }
  class n3 node_system
  class n3 external_node
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​atmosphere​_​textures**<br/>按大气设置准备四类查找纹理。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**prepare​_​atmosphere​_​buffers**<br/>上传各视图的大气和采样设置缓冲。" }
  class n5 node_system
  n1 e0@-->|"插入"| n0
  class e0 edge_write
  n1 e1@-->|"移除"| n0
  class e1 edge_write
  n0 e2@--> n2
  class e2 edge_read
  n0 e3@--> n3
  class e3 edge_read
  n0 e4@--> n4
  class e4 edge_read
  n0 e5@--> n5
  class e5 edge_read
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e1@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
  e3@{ curve: basis }
  e4@{ curve: basis }
  e5@{ curve: basis }
